<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, July 8 (Reuter) &quot;Zoodotis 50,000/10 tonnes dap Tampa/Nhavasheva 10/20 July approx. $24.50 fio 8,000/2,500 Cargill.</p>
<p>John L - 30,000/5 tonnes urea Black Sea/WC India 14/19 July $31.50 fio 6,000/1,200 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Penelope A - 25,000/5 tonnes urea Black Sea/WC India 15/20 July $32 fio 6,000/1,200 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Erodios - 14,500/5 tonnes  urea Marsa el Brega/WC India 10/15 July $31 fio 6,000/1,200 Indian Government.</p>
</text>
